# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local-only scratch
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# docs/ is published. It holds design rationale and the performance budget and
# is linked from CONTRIBUTING.md, so it must stay in the repository.
tools/__pycache__/

